e. Post ONE comment on issue 2340 whose first line reads CRITIC SETTLEMENT CHECK FIXES VERIFIED, with a verdict of SAFE-TO-MERGE or BLOCK-FIX or BLOCK-ESCALATE and per-finding file and line citations. No vendor names, emails, booking ids or gcloud payloads. | docs/settlement-empirical-check
